      "headline": "Handover Is Where Most Projects Break",
      "description": "In digital projects, handover is often the moment where the work is most vulnerable. Design intent becomes interpretation, and if the people building the thing were not part of the thinking, the work starts to drift. Handover is not a phase; it is a risk point.",
